    narr:generatedFrom "e3c75c2df1a4d6b8ce07850fdf733affe72074b3" ;
    narr:narration """Tanya's profile is a chair who converts deliberation into on-the-record rules, and the newest children sharpen that habit into formal self-supersession. The spine runs from [bounding the meeting against a steering-group deadline](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_1) through [stating her landing position before hearing others](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8), [pricing parallel cutovers as contained versus unbounded risk](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13), and [ordering the reporting constraint written as a rule, not guidance](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_31). She briefs a newcomer on the settled shape ([the one-at-a-time rule restated](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_7)) and [adopts someone else's sharper version of her own argument](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_13), [committing to lead with it](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_17). In the cutover review she [clarifies what is and isn't changing](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_10), [redirects recovered time into a buffer](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_18), and [formally supersedes her own earlier note on the record](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20). A fresh front opens on [the closed history left behind on the old platform](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_3), where she [adds her own reason for an obviously-closed archive](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_16) and [insists the retention number come from the lawyers in writing](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_20). With an outside advisor she [summarises the plan in one breath](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_3), [concedes a critique nobody internal had raised](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_20), and [commits to presenting the gap proactively](narr:Expr_6HalyardAdvisorTonyMaley20260929_28). The newest children are review comments where she [restates the supersession formally](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_8), [re-quotes the reasoning being replaced](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_15), and [holds a commitment made to her](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_19). The register stays casual-but-commanding, antithesis and parallelism dominant in her own lane, with consultation and legitimate authority run side by side.""" ;
    narr:reaction """Nothing moved here: the newest children are the review-comment re-quotes of the supersession and the held commitment that the prior narration already carried, and the voice profile — casual-but-commanding, antithesis and parallelism dominant, consultation beside legitimate authority — still holds as written.""" ;
